    route TX6.P7 to RX6.P7
    route TX7.P0 to RX7.P0
    route TX7.P1 to RX7.P1
    route TX7.P2 to RX7.P2
    route TX7.P3 to RX7.P3
    route TX7.P4 to RX7.P4
    route TX7.P5 to RX7.P5
    route TX7.P6 to RX7.P6
    route TX7.P7 to RX7.P7
    route TX8.P0 to RX8.P0
    route TX8.P1 to RX8.P1
